&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Mechatronics Teams at Agile Robots&lt;/strong&gt; are looking for an &lt;strong&gt;Electronics Test Engineer (m/f/d)&lt;/strong&gt;. Join our team at our Munich R&amp;amp;D site, where you will design, implement and validate the electronic circuits and software we use to test robot prototypes and subassemblies for development and certification. We are seeking a hands-on electrical engineer who works across circuit design, the lab bench and test software.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Test Electronics:&lt;/strong&gt; Design and implement the electronic circuits and software used to test robot prototypes and subassemblies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Test Analysis:&lt;/strong&gt; Evaluate and analyze test results and share the findings with the multidisciplinary engineering team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Root Cause Analysis:&lt;/strong&gt; Investigate production-related quality issues to determine their root cause.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Production Support:&lt;/strong&gt; Support the production team in troubleshooting and resolving test-related issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Test Procedures:&lt;/strong&gt; Identify and implement improvements to existing test procedures to make them more efficient and reliable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Documentation:&lt;/strong&gt; Create and maintain documentation for test procedures and results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Background:&lt;/strong&gt; Degree in electrical engineering or a related technical field, or an equivalent qualification plus professional experience in electronics testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Electronic Systems:&lt;/strong&gt; Solid understanding of electronic systems in robots, including PCB design, sensors and actuators, and motor control such as field-oriented control.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lab Work:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on electronics lab experience, including soldering, measurement with oscilloscopes, and cable design and manufacturing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Python Automation:&lt;/strong&gt; Professional experience writing Python to analyze test data and automate test benches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;System Testing:&lt;/strong&gt; Industry experience testing, verifying and analyzing electronic and robotic systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Driving License:&lt;/strong&gt; Valid driving license.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Beneficial Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
