&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Industrial Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Familiarity with industrial middleware such as OPC UA and fieldbus systems such as EtherCAT.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Embedded Interfaces:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience with Linux environments including Bash, embedded controllers, and interfaces such as CAN or SPI.&lt;/li&gt;
